    <marc:datafield tag="505" ind1="0" ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Starting with Aspen HYSYS -- Physical and thermodynamics properties -- Equipment of pressure change -- Flash separator -- Logical operations -- Piping equipment -- Reactors -- Separation columns -- Refinery process -- Optimizer -- Solid operation -- Dynamic state simulation -- Economic evaluation -- Plant wide projects.</marc:subfield>
    </marc:datafield>
    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">&quot;The book deals with the simulation and design of chemical, petrochemical, and petroleum industry processes using Aspen HYSYS. The book covers many chemical engineering topics including fluid flow, reactors, unit operation of heat and mass transfer, and control systems. The book includes highly interactive process flow diagram for building and navigating through large simulations&quot;-- Provided by publisher.</marc:subfield>
    </marc:datafield>
